{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Progressive Refinement.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Progressive Refinement.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"progressive refinement progressive refinement","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Progressive Refinement.md","fileName":"Progressive Refinement.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Progressive Refinement","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 13:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[UX Evaluation]] [[Software Engineering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["UX Evaluation","Software Engineering","Interaction Technique","Object Selection","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Progressive Refinement.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Progressive Refinement.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"progressive refinement progressive refinement","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Progressive Refinement.md","fileName":"Progressive Refinement.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Progressive Refinement","heading":"Progressive Refinement","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Progressive refinement divides a difficult selection into stages. A coarse first action reduces the set of possible targets, and later actions refine that set until one object remains.\n\nThis is useful when objects are small, distant, occluded, or densely packed. The first stage can favor speed and low precision, while the second presents a simpler arrangement or menu of candidates. This can avoid requiring a single exact movement and reduce fatigue.\n\nThe stages should remain fast and preserve the spatial relationship between candidates and their original locations. Progressive refinement is an [[Interaction Technique]] pattern for improving [[Object Selection]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["UX Evaluation","Software Engineering","Interaction Technique","Object Selection","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Progressive Refinement.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Progressive Refinement.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"progressive refinement progressive refinement","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Progressive Refinement.md","fileName":"Progressive Refinement.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Progressive Refinement","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["UX Evaluation","Software Engineering","Interaction Technique","Object Selection","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}